-- Ever-any |\ (ruled 2026-07-11): one latch along a route — has the fire reached each point yet. Trips on at the first true and stays on. Twin of s62-ever-any.bqn.
-- Decoy 1s sit behind !Path (rows 4, 7): any early 1 in the out is a selection leak; length 6 = popcount of the route pins the same-length invariant. The route's declared order is index order (the 16-scans convention).
--! registry ../registries/s62-ever-any.reg

--! out 0 0 1 1 1 1
|\ Burning @ Path
